# Seragamkan line ending semua file text jadi LF di dalam repo,
# supaya Git nggak perlu konversi bolak-balik CRLF<->LF pas commit/pull
# (itu sumber warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF..." kemarin).
* text=auto eol=lf

# File biner jangan disentuh sama sekali (jaga-jaga kalau ada gambar/font/pdf dsb)
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
